<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#e8dfef] bg-white shadow-2xl shadow-purple-950/10" data-controller="product-mockup" data-product-mockup-kind-value="<%= kind %>">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#e8dfef] bg-[#fff8df] px-4 py-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#f97316]"></span>
      <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#facc15]"></span>
      <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#7c3aed]"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="truncate text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[#655d6f]"><%= product_name %></p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-0 lg:grid-cols-[0.88fr_1.12fr]">
    <div class="bg-[#18111f] p-6 text-white sm:p-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#facc15]" data-product-mockup-target="eyebrow">Pré-visualização interactiva</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold" data-product-mockup-target="title">Cada projecto começa com uma primeira impressão cuidada.</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-purple-100" data-product-mockup-target="body">Explore os controlos para perceber como cada produto CPT pode funcionar num website real.</p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2" role="group" aria-label="Preview controls">
        <% mockup_actions.each_with_index do |(label, state), index| %>
          <button class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10 data-[active=true]:border-[#facc15] data-[active=true]:bg-[#facc15] data-[active=true]:text-[#18111f]" type="button" data-product-mockup-target="control" data-product-mockup-state-param="<%= state %>" data-active="<%= index.zero? %>" data-action="product-mockup#show">
            <%= label %>
          </button>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 text-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-white/10 px-4 py-3">
          <span data-product-mockup-target="metricLabel">Foco em conversão</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#facc15]" data-product-mockup-target="metric">Alto</span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-white/10">
          <div class="h-2 w-3/4 rounded-full bg-[#f97316]" data-product-mockup-target="progress"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-5 sm:p-8">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#e8dfef]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e8dfef] bg-[#f4edff] px-4 py-3">
          <div class="h-2 w-28 rounded-full bg-[#7c3aed]/30"></div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-8 rounded-full bg-[#f97316]/40"></span>
            <span class="h-2 w-8 rounded-full bg-[#facc15]/70"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid min-h-72 gap-5 p-5" data-product-mockup-target="screen">
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#18111f] p-5 text-white">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[#facc15]" data-product-mockup-target="screenEyebrow">Lançamento premium</p>
            <h4 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold" data-product-mockup-target="screenTitle">Uma página clara que torna a oferta óbvia.</h4>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-purple-100" data-product-mockup-target="screenBody">Hero, prova e chamada à acção afinados para clareza e confiança.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3" data-product-mockup-target="tiles">
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#fff1e7] p-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#9a3412]">Sinal</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-[#18111f]">98</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#fff8df] p-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#854d0e]">Confiança</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-[#18111f]">92%</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#f4edff] p-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#5b21b6]">Rapidez</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-[#18111f]">A+</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-[#e8dfef] p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#18111f]" data-product-mockup-target="actionTitle">Acção principal</p>
              <button class="rounded-full bg-[#f97316] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#18111f] transition hover:bg-[#facc15]" type="button" data-action="product-mockup#interact" data-product-mockup-target="actionButton">Experimentar</button>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#655d6f]" data-product-mockup-target="actionBody">As interacções são subtis e úteis: revelar prova, mudar secções, adicionar ao carrinho ou avançar um workflow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
